# TypeAssert: closed record annotation rejects dict missing a required field
# [@Any ...] wrapper causes infer_expr to return Any, which satisfies the record
# constraint at typecheck time, so resolved_type IS set and runtime validation catches the missing field.
[@[name: String  age: Int] [@Any [name: "hello"]]]
=== out
[E011] type assertion failed: expected record with field "age", got record missing field "age"
